*.pyc

# Test-run artifacts: regenerable from the submit script beside them (~15 min),
# and far too large for git (~67 MB of label CSVs). The submit_pipeline_*.sh copy
# in each test folder is the reproducible record; the outputs are not tracked.
tests/*/out/
tests/*/*.log
tests/*/slurm-*.out
tests/*/worker_logs/
tests/*/tmp_*/
